--- Why this file exists ---

169 source files carry the header "Use of this source code is governed by a
BSD-style license that can be found in the LICENSE file" and there was no
LICENSE file. Every one of those references pointed at nothing, and BSD-3
requires redistributions to retain the copyright notice and the license text.
The LICENSE beside this file is that text; this file is the attribution.

Upstream project names appear HERE and nowhere else — not in the README, the
repo description, or any identifier. That is the house rule for every import.
